# A 4x2 grid on paper, cells 64 px wide. Each shape carries fx outline 4, a ring drawn behind the shape and outside its edge.
# Top row, left to right:
# 1. A blue circle with a thick dark navy ring of even width, crisp on both sides.
# 2. A blue circle with a red ring (color:p.red), same width as cell 1.
# 3. fx blur 3 then outline: the blue circle is soft, its edge fading into the ring, but the ring's outer edge is crisp. The ring is not blurred.
# 4. fx shadow 8,8 blur:2 then outline: a blue square with a crisp dark ring on all four sides and a soft blue-gray shadow to the lower right. The ring has no soft edge and no offset copy.
# Bottom row, left to right:
# 5. fx glow in gold then outline: a blue circle with a crisp dark ring and a pale gold halo fading outward beyond the ring. The ring is unchanged by the glow.
# 6. A circle with a translucent blue fill (pale blue-lavender over paper) and a dark ink ring. The ring is full strength and no ring ink shows through the inside of the circle.
# 7. A parent circle with fill:none holding a green circle on the left and a gold circle on the right that overlap. One dark ink ring wraps the union of the two, with no ring line across the overlap.
# 8. A gold circle with a thick red stroke. A dark ink ring surrounds the red stroke on its outside, the gold interior is clean.
@target fx/outline.png 256x128

circle 18 at:32,32 fill:p.blue
  fx outline 4
circle 18 at:96,32 fill:p.blue
  fx outline 4 color:p.red
circle 18 at:160,32 fill:p.blue
  fx blur 3
  fx outline 4
rect 34x34 at:224,32 fill:p.blue
  fx shadow 8,8 blur:2
  fx outline 4
circle 18 at:32,96 fill:p.blue
  fx glow 10 color:p.gold
  fx outline 4
circle 18 at:96,96 fill:fade(p.blue .35)
  fx outline 4 color:p.ink
circle 22 at:160,96 fill:none
  circle 14 at:-8,0 fill:p.green
  circle 14 at:8,0 fill:p.gold
  fx outline 4 color:p.ink
circle 16 at:224,96 fill:p.gold stroke:p.red,6
  fx outline 4 color:p.ink
